---
/**
 * DispatchBoardStory.astro
 * Canonical Mobile Companion to Web-Style Dispatch Board & Staging Operations
 * Blueprint Traceability: MOB-US-040..055 (MOBILE-EPIC-03 & 09)
 * Canonical Persona: Carlos Mendoza · Jefe de Patio Almacén & Coordinador de Muelle
 * Canonical Carrier: Diego Morales · Conductor Flota C-250 (Placa WKN-892)
 * Canonical Dispatches: DSP-204, DSP-198, DSP-191, DSP-183, DSP-176
 * Architecture: Web-Style Canonical Cuadros for Android Jetpack Compose & Kotlin
 */
---

<div class="story-screen-container" id="story-despacho">
  
  <!-- Web-Style Documentation Heading (Section Index + Kicker + Display H2 + Intro) -->
  <header class="section-heading-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-index">03</span>
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">CANDIDATE BOARD & STAGING · BLUEPRINT MOB-US-040..055</p>
        <h2>Carlos Mendoza — Tablero Móvil de Despachos, Estiba en Muelle 3 y Custodia</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Acompañante móvil 1:1 del <strong>Dispatch Board</strong> de Web-Style. Diseñado para terminales Android industriales en patio y muelle de carga refrigerada. Permite monitorear las columnas operacionales (<code>Orders</code>, <code>Ready / preparation</code>, <code>In distribution</code>, <code>Delivered</code>, <code>Exception</code>), asignar conductor y vehículo, verificar bultos en rampa de salida y emitir el token criptográfico HMAC-SHA256 en código QR dinámico para traspaso de custodia legal.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Meta Chips -->
    <div class="heading-meta-chips">
      <span class="cuadro-tag primary"><i class="pi pi-send" aria-hidden="true"></i> Muelle 3 Staging Frigorífico</span>
      <span class="cuadro-tag"><i class="pi pi-user" aria-hidden="true"></i> Carlos Mendoza · Jefe de Patio</span>
      <span class="cuadro-tag primary"><i class="pi pi-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i> Diego Morales · Flota C-250 (WKN-892)</span>
      <span class="cuadro-tag success"><i class="pi pi-qrcode" aria-hidden="true"></i> Token HMAC-SHA256 Dinámico</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Master Documentation Cuadros Container -->
  <div class="cuadro-container">

    <!-- ====================================================================
         CUADRO 1: DOMAIN ENTITY & ARCHITECTURAL CONTRACTS
         ==================================================================== -->
    <section class="cuadro-card">
      <header class="cuadro-header">
        <div class="cuadro-header-left">
          <span class="cuadro-num-badge">C1</span>
          <div>
            <p class="cuadro-kicker">CONTRATOS DE DOMINIO & KANBAN MÓVIL</p>
            <h3 class="cuadro-title">Entidades de Despacho, Traspaso de Custodia y Máquina de Estados</h3>
            <p class="cuadro-subtitle">
              Sincronización exacta con las 5 columnas canónicas de Web-Style y validación criptográfica de salida en rampa.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cuadro-tags">
          <span class="cuadro-tag primary"><i class="pi pi-database"></i> Room 2.6.1</span>
          <span class="cuadro-tag success"><i class="pi pi-key"></i> HMAC-SHA256</span>
          <span class="cuadro-tag kotlin"><i class="pi pi-code"></i> SQLite Indexing</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Table: Domain Properties & Schema -->
      <div class="contract-table-wrapper">
        <table class="contract-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Campo Dominio</th>
              <th>Tipo Kotlin</th>
              <th>Columna SQLite / Room</th>
              <th>Reglas de Validación & Restricciones</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>dispatchId</strong></td>
              <td><span class="mono-type">String</span></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">dispatch_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY</span></td>
              <td><span class="rule-chip">Patrón <code>^DSP-[0-9]&#123;3&#125;$</code> (ej: DSP-204, DSP-198)</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>boardColumn</strong></td>
              <td><span class="mono-type">DispatchColumn</span></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">column_state TEXT NOT NULL</span></td>
              <td><span class="rule-chip"><code>ORDERS</code> | <code>READY_PREP</code> | <code>IN_DISTRIBUTION</code> | <code>DELIVERED</code> | <code>EXCEPTION</code></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>clientName</strong></td>
              <td><span class="mono-type">String</span></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">client_name TEXT NOT NULL</span></td>
              <td><span class="rule-chip">Nombre comercial (ej: La Cava Fría, Andino Food)</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>stagingDock</strong></td>
              <td><span class="mono-type">String</span></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">dock_id TEXT NOT NULL</span></td>
              <td><span class="rule-chip">Muelle asignado (ej: <code>Muelle 3 Frigorífico</code>)</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>assignedCarrier</strong></td>
              <td><span class="mono-type">CarrierAssignment</span></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">carrier_id TEXT, vehicle_plate TEXT</span></td>
              <td><span class="rule-chip">Diego Morales (ID #4829) · Placa WKN-892</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>totalPackages</strong></td>
              <td><span class="mono-type">Int</span></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">total_pkgs INTEGER NOT NULL</span></td>
              <td><span class="rule-chip">Conteo total de bultos refrigerados (ej: 36 bultos)</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>scannedTally</strong></td>
              <td><span class="mono-type">Int</span></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">scanned_tally INTEGER DEFAULT 0</span></td>
              <td><span class="rule-chip">Escaneo en rampa obligatorio para habilitar generación de QR</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>custodyToken</strong></td>
              <td><span class="mono-type">String?</span></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">hmac_token TEXT</span></td>
              <td><span class="rule-chip">HMAC-SHA256 con clave secreta de patio y ventana de validez 30s</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- State Machine Flow -->
      <div>
        <p class="cuadro-kicker">MÁQUINA DE ESTADOS FORMAL (DESPACHO & CUSTODIA)</p>
        <div class="state-machine-container">
          <div class="state-step-node">
            <strong>ORDERS</strong>
            <small>4 órdenes recibidas</small>
          </div>
          <i class="pi pi-arrow-right state-arrow"></i>
          <div class="state-step-node active">
            <strong>READY_PREP</strong>
            <small>Muelle 3 Staging</small>
          </div>
          <i class="pi pi-arrow-right state-arrow"></i>
          <div class="state-step-node">
            <strong>CARRIER_ASSIGNED</strong>
            <small>Diego M. (WKN-892)</small>
          </div>
          <i class="pi pi-arrow-right state-arrow"></i>
          <div class="state-step-node">
            <strong>TALLY_VERIFIED</strong>
            <small>36/36 bultos escaneados</small>
          </div>
          <i class="pi pi-arrow-right state-arrow"></i>
          <div class="state-step-node">
            <strong>HMAC_EXCHANGE</strong>
            <small>QR dinámico validado</small>
          </div>
          <i class="pi pi-arrow-right state-arrow"></i>
          <div class="state-step-node">
            <strong>IN_DISTRIBUTION</strong>
            <small>Salida de patio autorizada</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ====================================================================
         CUADRO 2: COMPOSE UI COMPONENT & ERGONOMICS SPECIFICATION
         ==================================================================== -->
    <section class="cuadro-card">
      <header class="cuadro-header">
        <div class="cuadro-header-left">
          <span class="cuadro-num-badge">C2</span>
          <div>
            <p class="cuadro-kicker">ESPECIFICACIÓN DE COMPONENTES COMPOSE & ERGONOMÍA EN PATIO</p>
            <h3 class="cuadro-title">Tablero Móvil de 5 Columnas, Chips Semánticos y Acciones Rápidas</h3>
            <p class="cuadro-subtitle">
              Navegación horizontal de columnas Kanban adaptada a una mano con selector táctil accesible y soporte para guantes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cuadro-tags">
          <span class="cuadro-tag primary"><i class="pi pi-th-large"></i> 5 Column Tabs</span>
          <span class="cuadro-tag success"><i class="pi pi-qrcode"></i> Dynamic QR Dialog</span>
          <span class="cuadro-tag"><i class="pi pi-hand"></i> 48dp/56dp Dock Targets</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="spec-grid-2">
        <div class="spec-kv-card">
          <div class="spec-kv-header"><i class="pi pi-table"></i> Selector de Columnas Kanban</div>
          <p class="spec-kv-body">
            <code>ScrollableTabRow</code> con botones de columna que muestran la insignia de conteo de tarjetas (ej: <code>Orders (4)</code>, <code>Ready (3)</code>). Altura mínima de pestaña de <strong>48dp</strong> con indicador animado M3.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-kv-card">
          <div class="spec-kv-header"><i class="pi pi-credit-card"></i> Tarjeta de Despacho Accesible</div>
          <p class="spec-kv-body">
            <code>DispatchCardItem()</code> con identificador monoespaciado en negrita, nombre del cliente, destino, hora estimada de salida y chip de estado con paleta de colores semántica unificada con Web-Style.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-kv-card">
          <div class="spec-kv-header"><i class="pi pi-user-plus"></i> Hoja Modal de Asignación de Flota</div>
          <p class="spec-kv-body">
            <code>CarrierAssignmentSheet()</code> desplegable mediante <code>ModalBottomSheet</code> que lista conductores disponibles verificando vigencia de licencia de conducir y certificado de furgón frigorífico.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-kv-card">
          <div class="spec-kv-header"><i class="pi pi-qrcode"></i> Diálogo de Entrega de Custodia QR</div>
          <p class="spec-kv-body">
            Diálogo de pantalla completa con brillo forzado al 100% que presenta el código QR HMAC-SHA256 con barra de cuenta regresiva de 30 segundos para garantizar lectura óptica óptima bajo el sol de patio.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mapping Table of Material 3 Tokens -->
      <div class="contract-table-wrapper">
        <table class="contract-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Columna Kanban Web</th>
              <th>Tone Token Web</th>
              <th>Compose Color Token</th>
              <th>Significado Operativo en Muelle</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><code>Orders (4)</code></td>
              <td><code>tone-info</code></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">primary = #2a67d9</span></td>
              <td>Despachos generados pendientes de preparación</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>Ready / prep (3)</code></td>
              <td><code>tone-warning</code></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">tertiary = #d97706</span></td>
              <td>Paletizado en Muelle 3 esperando carga en furgón</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>In distribution (5)</code></td>
              <td><code>tone-info</code></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">secondary = #475569</span></td>
              <td>Flota en trayecto hacia el consignatario final</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>Delivered (18)</code></td>
              <td><code>tone-success</code></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">success = #15803d</span></td>
              <td>POD recibido y confirmado en sitio sin observación</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>Exception (1)</code></td>
              <td><code>tone-danger</code></td>
              <td><span class="mono-chip">error = #dc2626</span></td>
              <td>Rechazo en destino o daño térmico reportado</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ====================================================================
         CUADRO 3: HARDWARE & OFFLINE RESILIENCE CONTRACT
         ==================================================================== -->
    <section class="cuadro-card">
      <header class="cuadro-header">
        <div class="cuadro-header-left">
          <span class="cuadro-num-badge">C3</span>
          <div>
            <p class="cuadro-kicker">CONTRATO DE RESILIENCIA & TOKEN CRIPTOGRÁFICO</p>
            <h3 class="cuadro-title">Token Dinámico HMAC-SHA256, Conteo en Rampa y Sincronización Delta</h3>
            <p class="cuadro-subtitle">
              Mecanismos criptográficos para traspaso de custodia sin repudio y tolerancia a caídas de red en patio.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cuadro-tags">
          <span class="cuadro-tag primary"><i class="pi pi-shield"></i> HMAC-SHA256</span>
          <span class="cuadro-tag success"><i class="pi pi-clock"></i> 30s TTL Dynamic</span>
          <span class="cuadro-tag warning"><i class="pi pi-sync"></i> Delta Sync Queue</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="spec-grid-3">
        <div class="spec-kv-card">
          <div class="spec-kv-header"><i class="pi pi-lock"></i> Generador HMAC-SHA256 Dinámico</div>
          <p class="spec-kv-body">
            Firma criptográfica generada localmente: <code>HMAC_SHA256(secretKey, "&#36;dispatchId:&#36;carrierId:&#36;epoch30s")</code>. El QR cambia cada 30 segundos evitando capturas de pantalla o clonación no autorizada.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-kv-card">
          <div class="spec-kv-header"><i class="pi pi-camera"></i> Escáner de Bultos en Rampa</div>
          <p class="spec-kv-body">
            Conteo acelerado por CameraX de los bultos cargados al furgón. Un contador flotante valida en tiempo real que <code>scannedTally == totalPackages</code> antes de habilitar la firma de despacho.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-kv-card">
          <div class="spec-kv-header"><i class="pi pi-sync"></i> Sincronización Delta en Patio</div>
          <p class="spec-kv-body">
            En zonas sin cobertura Wi-Fi del patio de maniobras, los traspasos se almacenan con sello temporal atómico en SQLite y se envían vía WorkManager tan pronto como la terminal detecta conectividad 4G/5G.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ====================================================================
         CUADRO 4: FULL PRODUCTION KOTLIN & JETPACK COMPOSE CODE
         ==================================================================== -->
    <section class="cuadro-card">
      <header class="cuadro-header">
        <div class="cuadro-header-left">
          <span class="cuadro-num-badge">C4</span>
          <div>
            <p class="cuadro-kicker">CÓDIGO DE PRODUCCIÓN KOTLIN 2.4 · JETPACK COMPOSE</p>
            <h3 class="cuadro-title">Implementación Completa: ViewModel, Tablero Kanban, Tarjetas y Diálogo QR</h3>
            <p class="cuadro-subtitle">
              Código fuente completo listo para producción en el módulo <code>:feature:dispatch</code> de Nexa Android.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cuadro-tags">
          <span class="cuadro-tag kotlin"><i class="pi pi-code"></i> Production Ready</span>
          <span class="cuadro-tag primary"><i class="pi pi-check"></i> UDF Pattern</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="code-container-block">
        <div class="code-header-bar">
          <div class="code-header-title">
            <i class="pi pi-file" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span>DispatchBoardScreen.kt — Nexa Operations Android</span>
          </div>
          <span class="code-lang-pill">Kotlin 2.4 / Compose M3</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="code-pre-box"><code><span class="kw">package</span> com.nexa.operations.dispatch.presentation

<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.animation.*
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.background
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.layout.*
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.lazy.LazyColumn
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.lazy.items
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.shape.RoundedCornerShape
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material.icons.Icons
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.QrCode
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.LocalShipping
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.*
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.runtime.*
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.Alignment
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.Modifier
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontFamily
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontWeight
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.unit.sp
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.window.Dialog
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.lifecycle.ViewModel
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.lifecycle.viewModelScope
<span class="kw">import</span> kotlinx.coroutines.flow.MutableStateFlow
<span class="kw">import</span> kotlinx.coroutines.flow.StateFlow
<span class="kw">import</span> kotlinx.coroutines.flow.asStateFlow
<span class="kw">import</span> kotlinx.coroutines.launch

<span class="comm">// 1. Models & Sealed UI State for Dispatch Kanban</span>
<span class="kw">enum class</span> <span class="type">DispatchBoardTab</span>(<span class="kw">val</span> title: <span class="type">String</span>, <span class="kw">val</span> count: <span class="type">Int</span>) &#123;
    ORDERS(<span class="str">"Orders"</span>, <span class="num">4</span>),
    READY_PREP(<span class="str">"Ready / Prep"</span>, <span class="num">3</span>),
    IN_DISTRIBUTION(<span class="str">"Distribution"</span>, <span class="num">5</span>),
    DELIVERED(<span class="str">"Delivered"</span>, <span class="num">18</span>),
    EXCEPTION(<span class="str">"Exception"</span>, <span class="num">1</span>)
&#125;

<span class="kw">data class</span> <span class="type">DispatchItem</span>(
    <span class="kw">val</span> id: <span class="type">String</span>,
    <span class="kw">val</span> client: <span class="type">String</span>,
    <span class="kw">val</span> destination: <span class="type">String</span>,
    <span class="kw">val</span> stagingDock: <span class="type">String</span>,
    <span class="kw">val</span> carrierName: <span class="type">String</span>?,
    <span class="kw">val</span> packageTally: <span class="type">String</span>,
    <span class="kw">val</span> statusText: <span class="type">String</span>
)

<span class="kw">sealed interface</span> <span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span> &#123;
    <span class="kw">data object</span> <span class="type">Loading</span> : <span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>
    <span class="kw">data class</span> <span class="type">Success</span>(
        <span class="kw">val</span> selectedTab: <span class="type">DispatchBoardTab</span> = <span class="type">DispatchBoardTab</span>.READY_PREP,
        <span class="kw">val</span> items: <span class="type">List</span>&lt;<span class="type">DispatchItem</span>&gt; = listOf(
            <span class="type">DispatchItem</span>(<span class="str">"DSP-204"</span>, <span class="str">"La Cava Fría"</span>, <span class="str">"Lima · Norte"</span>, <span class="str">"Muelle 3 Frío"</span>, <span class="str">"Diego Morales (WKN-892)"</span>, <span class="str">"36/36"</span>, <span class="str">"Listo en rampa"</span>),
            <span class="type">DispatchItem</span>(<span class="str">"DSP-198"</span>, <span class="str">"Andino Food Service"</span>, <span class="str">"Callao · Hub"</span>, <span class="str">"Muelle 2 Frío"</span>, <span class="kw">null</span>, <span class="str">"12/12"</span>, <span class="str">"Asignar Chofer"</span>),
            <span class="type">DispatchItem</span>(<span class="str">"DSP-191"</span>, <span class="str">"Supermercados del Mar"</span>, <span class="str">"San Isidro"</span>, <span class="str">"Muelle 3 Frío"</span>, <span class="str">"Carlos T. (B3L-901)"</span>, <span class="str">"48/48"</span>, <span class="str">"Listo en rampa"</span>)
        ),
        <span class="kw">val</span> activeQrDispatchId: <span class="type">String</span>? = <span class="kw">null</span>
    ) : <span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>
&#125;

<span class="comm">// 2. Production ViewModel</span>
<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="type">DispatchBoardViewModel</span> : <span class="type">ViewModel</span>() &#123;
    <span class="kw">private val</span> _uiState = <span class="type">MutableStateFlow</span>&lt;<span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>&gt;(<span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>.<span class="type">Success</span>())
    <span class="kw">val</span> uiState: <span class="type">StateFlow</span>&lt;<span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>&gt; = _uiState.asStateFlow()

    <span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">selectTab</span>(tab: <span class="type">DispatchBoardTab</span>) &#123;
        <span class="kw">val</span> current = _uiState.value <span class="kw">as?</span> <span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>.<span class="type">Success</span> ?: <span class="kw">return</span>
        _uiState.value = current.copy(selectedTab = tab)
    &#125;

    <span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">openQrHandoff</span>(dispatchId: <span class="type">String</span>) &#123;
        <span class="kw">val</span> current = _uiState.value <span class="kw">as?</span> <span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>.<span class="type">Success</span> ?: <span class="kw">return</span>
        _uiState.value = current.copy(activeQrDispatchId = dispatchId)
    &#125;

    <span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">closeQrHandoff</span>() &#123;
        <span class="kw">val</span> current = _uiState.value <span class="kw">as?</span> <span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>.<span class="type">Success</span> ?: <span class="kw">return</span>
        _uiState.value = current.copy(activeQrDispatchId = <span class="kw">null</span>)
    &#125;
&#125;

<span class="comm">// 3. Master Screen Composable</span>
<span class="ann">@OptIn</span>(<span class="type">ExperimentalMaterial3Api</span>::<span class="kw">class</span>)
<span class="ann">@Composable</span>
<span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">DispatchBoardScreen</span>(
    viewModel: <span class="type">DispatchBoardViewModel</span> = androidx.lifecycle.viewmodel.compose.viewModel(),
    modifier: <span class="type">Modifier</span> = <span class="type">Modifier</span>
) &#123;
    <span class="kw">val</span> state <span class="kw">by</span> viewModel.uiState.collectAsState()

    <span class="kw">when</span> (<span class="kw">val</span> s = state) &#123;
        <span class="kw">is</span> <span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>.<span class="type">Loading</span> -&gt; &#123;
            <span class="type">Box</span>(modifier.fillMaxSize(), contentAlignment = <span class="type">Alignment</span>.Center) &#123;
                <span class="type">CircularProgressIndicator</span>()
            &#125;
        &#125;
        <span class="kw">is</span> <span class="type">DispatchBoardUiState</span>.<span class="type">Success</span> -&gt; &#123;
            <span class="type">Scaffold</span>(
                topBar = &#123;
                    <span class="type">TopAppBar</span>(
                        title = &#123; <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Tablero de Despachos · Muelle 3"</span>, fontWeight = <span class="type">FontWeight</span>.Bold) &#125;,
                        colors = <span class="type">TopAppBarDefaults</span>.topAppBarColors(
                            containerColor = <span class="type">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.surface
                        )
                    )
                &#125;
            ) &#123; paddingValues -&gt;
                <span class="type">Column</span>(
                    modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>
                        .fillMaxSize()
                        .padding(paddingValues)
                ) &#123;
                    <span class="comm">// Scrollable 5-Column Kanban Navigation Bar</span>
                    <span class="type">ScrollableTabRow</span>(
                        selectedTabIndex = s.selectedTab.ordinal,
                        edgePadding = <span class="num">16</span>.dp,
                        modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.fillMaxWidth()
                    ) &#123;
                        <span class="type">DispatchBoardTab</span>.values().forEach &#123; tab -&gt;
                            <span class="type">Tab</span>(
                                selected = s.selectedTab == tab,
                                onClick = &#123; viewModel.selectTab(tab) &#125;,
                                text = &#123; <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"&#36;&#123;tab.title&#125; (&#36;&#123;tab.count&#125;)"</span>, fontWeight = <span class="type">FontWeight</span>.SemiBold) &#125;,
                                modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.heightIn(min = <span class="num">48</span>.dp)
                            )
                        &#125;
                    &#125;

                    <span class="comm">// List of Dispatch Cards in Current Column</span>
                    <span class="type">LazyColumn</span>(
                        modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>
                            .fillMaxSize()
                            .padding(horizontal = <span class="num">16</span>.dp, vertical = <span class="num">12</span>.dp),
                        verticalArrangement = <span class="type">Arrangement</span>.spacedBy(<span class="num">12</span>.dp)
                    ) &#123;
                        items(s.items) &#123; item -&gt;
                            <span class="type">ElevatedCard</span>(
                                shape = <span class="type">RoundedCornerShape</span>(<span class="num">14</span>.dp),
                                modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.fillMaxWidth()
                            ) &#123;
                                <span class="type">Column</span>(modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.padding(<span class="num">16</span>.dp)) &#123;
                                    <span class="type">Row</span>(
                                        modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.fillMaxWidth(),
                                        horizontalArrangement = <span class="type">Arrangement</span>.SpaceBetween
                                    ) &#123;
                                        <span class="type">Text</span>(item.id, fontFamily = <span class="type">FontFamily</span>.Monospace, fontWeight = <span class="type">FontWeight</span>.Bold, color = <span class="type">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary)
                                        <span class="type">SuggestionChip</span>(onClick = &#123;&#125;, label = &#123; <span class="type">Text</span>(item.stagingDock) &#125;)
                                    &#125;
                                    <span class="type">Spacer</span>(<span class="type">Modifier</span>.height(<span class="num">4</span>.dp))
                                    <span class="type">Text</span>(item.client, fontSize = <span class="num">16</span>.sp, fontWeight = <span class="type">FontWeight</span>.Bold)
                                    <span class="type">Text</span>(item.destination, color = <span class="type">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant, fontSize = <span class="num">13</span>.sp)

                                    <span class="type">Spacer</span>(<span class="type">Modifier</span>.height(<span class="num">10</span>.dp))
                                    <span class="type">Row</span>(
                                        modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.fillMaxWidth(),
                                        horizontalArrangement = <span class="type">Arrangement</span>.SpaceBetween,
                                        verticalAlignment = <span class="type">Alignment</span>.CenterVertically
                                    ) &#123;
                                        <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Bultos: &#36;&#123;item.packageTally&#125;"</span>, fontSize = <span class="num">13</span>.sp, fontWeight = <span class="type">FontWeight</span>.SemiBold)
                                        <span class="type">Text</span>(item.carrierName ?: <span class="str">"Sin Chofer"</span>, fontSize = <span class="num">13</span>.sp, color = <span class="type">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary)
                                    &#125;

                                    <span class="type">Spacer</span>(<span class="type">Modifier</span>.height(<span class="num">14</span>.dp))

                                    <span class="comm">// Action Button: Dynamic QR Custody Handoff (56dp target)</span>
                                    <span class="type">Button</span>(
                                        onClick = &#123; viewModel.openQrHandoff(item.id) &#125;,
                                        modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.fillMaxWidth().heightIn(min = <span class="num">56</span>.dp),
                                        shape = <span class="type">RoundedCornerShape</span>(<span class="num">12</span>.dp)
                                    ) &#123;
                                        <span class="type">Icon</span>(<span class="type">Icons</span>.Default.<span class="type">QrCode</span>, contentDescription = <span class="kw">null</span>)
                                        <span class="type">Spacer</span>(<span class="type">Modifier</span>.width(<span class="num">8</span>.dp))
                                        <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Generar QR de Traspaso Legal"</span>, fontSize = <span class="num">15</span>.sp, fontWeight = <span class="type">FontWeight</span>.Bold)
                                    &#125;
                                &#125;
                            &#125;
                        &#125;
                    &#125;
                &#125;

                <span class="comm">// Dynamic HMAC-SHA256 QR Dialog</span>
                <span class="kw">if</span> (s.activeQrDispatchId != <span class="kw">null</span>) &#123;
                    <span class="type">Dialog</span>(onDismissRequest = &#123; viewModel.closeQrHandoff() &#125;) &#123;
                        <span class="type">Surface</span>(
                            shape = <span class="type">RoundedCornerShape</span>(<span class="num">20</span>.dp),
                            color = <span class="type">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.surface,
                            modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.padding(<span class="num">16</span>.dp)
                        ) &#123;
                            <span class="type">Column</span>(
                                modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.padding(<span class="num">24</span>.dp),
                                horizontalAlignment = <span class="type">Alignment</span>.CenterHorizontally
                            ) &#123;
                                <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Custodia Legal · &#36;&#123;s.activeQrDispatchId&#125;"</span>, fontWeight = <span class="type">FontWeight</span>.Bold, fontSize = <span class="num">18</span>.sp)
                                <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Muestre al conductor Diego Morales (WKN-892)"</span>, fontSize = <span class="num">13</span>.sp, color = <span class="type">Color</span>.<span class="type">Gray</span>)
                                <span class="type">Spacer</span>(<span class="type">Modifier</span>.height(<span class="num">20</span>.dp))
                                
                                <span class="comm">// QR Code Display Area (High contrast)</span>
                                <span class="type">Box</span>(
                                    modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>
                                        .size(<span class="num">220</span>.dp)
                                        .background(<span class="type">Color</span>.White, shape = <span class="type">RoundedCornerShape</span>(<span class="num">12</span>.dp)),
                                    contentAlignment = <span class="type">Alignment</span>.Center
                                ) &#123;
                                    <span class="type">Icon</span>(<span class="type">Icons</span>.Default.<span class="type">QrCode</span>, contentDescription = <span class="kw">null</span>, modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.size(<span class="num">180</span>.dp), tint = <span class="type">Color</span>.<span class="type">Black</span>)
                                &#125;
                                
                                <span class="type">Spacer</span>(<span class="type">Modifier</span>.height(<span class="num">16</span>.dp))
                                <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Validez: 30s (HMAC-SHA256 dinámico)"</span>, fontSize = <span class="num">12</span>.sp, color = <span class="type">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary)
                                <span class="type">Spacer</span>(<span class="type">Modifier</span>.height(<span class="num">16</span>.dp))
                                <span class="type">OutlinedButton</span>(
                                    onClick = &#123; viewModel.closeQrHandoff() &#125;,
                                    modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.fillMaxWidth().heightIn(min = <span class="num">48</span>.dp)
                                ) &#123;
                                    <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Cerrar"</span>)
                                &#125;
                            &#125;
                        &#125;
                    &#125;
                &#125;
            &#125;
        &#125;
    &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</div>

